{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/242464-please-review-my-updated-healing-house-rules","id":242464,"title":"Please Review my Updated Healing House Rules","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-27T12:55:16-07:00","id":242464,"title":"Please Review my Updated Healing House Rules","content":"We enjoy a high-action game. Here's one of our house rules to allow additional healing. It's been scaled back significantly since my first post to keep it from taking away from existing embeds, exploits, and Demonic Form abilities.<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Aetheric Healing</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">: In Demonic Form, Demons may spend 1 Aether as a reflexive action to heal Primium (roll) successes bashing or lethal damage, and then roll for a temporary (Permanent if Failure) Glitch (Primium) + wounds healed. </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i><span style=\"font-size:15px\">RAW: Demons reflexively heal Primium Bashing or Lethal damage on assuming Demonic Form.</span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> Should I limit this to X number of times per scene/chapter? If so...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T18:30:05-07:00","id":242733,"title":"","content":"With one primium, the chance for permanent glitches and a primium is too damn high for one meager health level. The roll should be give a decent chance of recovering some damage. Primium + Stamina, perhaps?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T07:22:13-07:00","id":243081,"title":"","content":"Thank you!<br /> <br /> So what do you think of (1) Primium + Stamina Healed OR (2) changing the + to TIMES PERFORMED - 1 OR (3) changing Permanent to DRAMATIC FAILURE","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T15:32:06-07:00","id":247193,"title":"","content":"1 *and* 3, I'd say. And even then, primium is difficult to get. In games with high combat quotient, they will run without primium quite often. <br /> <br /> Demons should really only get Permanent Glitches on a dramatic failure! If you want to get a high-action game, getting permanent glitches so easily is a no-go. Otherwise, In a few sessions, you would be getting a damn freakshow!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T09:06:22-07:00","id":247901,"title":"","content":"Thanks. 1 and 3 it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/354-pencilboy99","name":"PencilBoy99","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}